{"sha": "3af05e8a281a5aef189be3a1b528481fb91b0072b4aadffbf59696236df52a0d", "body": ["\\begin{theorem}[范托夫渗透压定律]\\label{thm:b2:chemical-potential:osmosis}", "对于稀溶液，$\\Pi = c\\,RT$，其中 $c$ 为溶质粒子的", "总浓度。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "平衡时，溶剂在两侧的化学势相等：", "$\\mu_1^*(T, p) = \\mu_1^*(T, p + \\Pi) + RT\\ln x_1$。由于 $(\\partial\\mu_1^*/", "\\partial p)_T = V_{m,1}$，且对液体近似为常数，故 $\\mu_1^*(T, p + \\Pi) -", "\\mu_1^*(T, p) = \\Pi V_{m,1}$，于是 $\\Pi V_{m,1} = -RT\\ln x_1 \\approx RT x_2", "\\approx RT\\,n_2/n_1$。由 $n_1V_{m,1} \\approx V$（稀溶液）得 $\\Pi = n_2RT/V$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, >={Stealth}]", "  \\begin{scope}", "    \\clip (-0.85,2.8) -- (-0.85,0.85) arc[start angle=180, end angle=360,", "      radius=0.85] -- (0.85,2.8) -- (0.55,2.8) -- (0.55,0.85)", "      arc[start angle=0, end angle=-180, radius=0.55] -- (-0.55,2.8) -- cycle;", "    \\fill[omDef!18] (-1,0) rectangle (0,1.6);", "    \\fill[omThm!22] (0,0) rectangle (1,2.3);", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\pic at (0,0) {utube={0}{white}};", "  \\draw[very thick, dashed] (0,-0.05) -- (0,0.36);", "  \\node[left] at (-1.0,1.2) {纯水};", "  \\node[right] at (1.0,0.9) {溶液};", "  \\draw[densely dotted] (-0.55,1.6) -- (1.55,1.6);", "  \\draw[densely dotted] (0.85,2.3) -- (1.55,2.3);", "  \\draw[<->, thick] (1.45,1.6) -- (1.45,2.3) node[midway, right] {$h$，$\\Pi = \\rho g h$};", "  \\draw (0,0.12) -- (0.6,-0.5) node[below right] {半透膜};", "  \\draw[->, omDef, thick] (-0.75,0.4) to[bend right=30] (-0.25,0.12);", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small U 形管中的渗透。水穿过膜进入溶液，", "直到较高液柱附加的静水压强等于", "渗透压为止；此时膜两侧水的化学势", "相等。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[由依数性测定摩尔质量]\\label{met:b2:chemical-potential:molar-mass}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 将已知质量 $m_2$ 的物质溶于已知质量 $m_1$ 的", "        溶剂中（或溶于已知体积 $V$ 的溶液中）。", "  \\item 测量 $\\Delta T_f$（或 $\\Delta T_b$，或 $\\Pi$）。", "  \\item 由此求得质量摩尔浓度 $b = \\Delta T_f/K_f$（或 $c = \\Pi/RT$），进而 $n_2 =", "        b\\,m_1$（或 $cV$），$M_2 = m_2/n_2$；若物质发生解离，", "        则需除以每个化学式对应的粒子数。", "\\end{enumerate}", "渗透法适用于大分子（蛋白质、聚合物）：每升含几克、", "摩尔质量为 \\qty{60}{kg/mol} 的蛋白质，可产生几百帕斯卡、即几毫米", "水柱的压强，但凝固点仅变化几千分之一开尔文。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:chemical-potential:1}", "利用图中摩尔体积（模型", "混合物）在 $x_2 = 0.4$ 处的切线作图，读出 $\\bar V_1$ 和 $\\bar V_2$，并验证", "$x_1\\bar V_1 + x_2\\bar V_2$ 即为混合物的摩尔体积。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:chemical-potential:2}", "在 \\qty{25}{\\celsius} 时，水的蒸气压为 \\qty{3.17}{kPa}。", "用拉乌尔定律计算：将", "\\qty{1.00}{mol} 蔗糖（不挥发）溶于 \\qty{1.00}{kg} 水中所得溶液上方的蒸气压。", "% ledger: pvap:H2O.298", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:chemical-potential:3}", "计算与空气平衡的水中溶解氧的浓度", "（\\qty{1.013}{bar}、\\qty{25}{\\celsius}，$H(\\ce{O2}) =", "\\qty{1.3e-5}{mol/(m^3.Pa)}$，氧气占 \\qty{20.95}{\\percent}），分别以", "\\unit{mol/L} 和 \\unit{mg/L} 表示。", "% ledger: henry:O2, air:O2", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:chemical-potential:4}", "对于 \\ce{N2(g) + 3H2(g) <=> 2NH3(g)}，在 \\qty{298}{K} 时 $\\Delta_r G^\\circ =", "\\qty{-32.8}{kJ/mol}$。在下述混合物中计算 $\\Delta_r G$：", "$p(\\ce{N2}) = \\qty{1.0}{bar}$、$p(\\ce{H2}) = \\qty{0.010}{bar}$、", "$p(\\ce{NH3}) = \\qty{1.0}{bar}$，并判断反应向哪个方向进行。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:chemical-potential:5}", "在二元混合物中，组分 1 的偏摩尔体积改变", "$\\dd\\bar V_1 = \\qty{-0.30}{mL/mol}$，此时 $x_2$ 从 0.30 变为 0.31。利用", "吉布斯–杜安方程求 $\\dd\\bar V_2$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:chemical-potential:6}", "生理盐水中每升含 \\qty{9.0}{g} 氯化钠。", "计算其在 \\qty{37}{\\celsius} 时的渗透压（假定盐完全", "解离），并说明为什么红细胞在其中能保持形状，而在纯水中", "会膨胀直至破裂。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:chemical-potential:7}", "将 \\qty{2.00}{g} 某蛋白质溶于 \\qty{100.0}{mL} 水中，所得溶液", "在 \\qty{25}{\\celsius} 时的渗透压为 \\qty{0.825}{kPa}。求该蛋白质的摩尔", "质量，以及该溶液的凝固点降低值。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:chemical-potential:8}", "用极限定律计算下列溶液的离子强度和平均活度系数：", "(a) \\qty{1.0e-3}{mol/kg} 氯化钠；(b) \\qty{1.0e-3}{mol/kg}", "氯化钙；(c) \\qty{1.0e-3}{mol/kg} 硫酸镁。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:chemical-potential:9}", "将 \\qty{1.50}{g} 某未知的不挥发、不解离化合物", "溶于 \\qty{50.0}{g} 水中，所得溶液在 \\qty{-0.310}{\\celsius} 凝固。求", "该化合物的摩尔质量。", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}